# Frontend (React)

## Structure
`src/features/{source-material|course-authoring|course-content|synchronization|student-learning|assessments|notifications}`

Colocate API client, hooks, types, and screens per feature.

## UX for sync (critical)
- Show impact level (HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW) before regenerate.
- Selective checkboxes — never force update-all.
- Diff/compare when `manualModification=true`.
- Poll `operationId` for long-running jobs; show progress.

## API
- Typed clients; map `correlationId` into error toasts.
- Never call LLM from the browser.

## Auth (v1)
Mock role switcher is OK; still gate routes by role permissions from the PRD.
